{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find and grab the object if visible, or scan the area to look for it. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    />",
